@host = http://localhost:8081

### D1 - past date (expected 400 Grooming session date cannot be in the past)
POST {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/save
Content-Type: application/json

{"sessionDate": "2026-10-01", "status": "BOOKED", "service": "Test", "petOwner": {"id": "652c2aa0-09fd-4016-8eff-3317e65a75f0"}, "groomer": {"id": "5c4e609d-f4d6-4ee8-ab45-3c71287204de"}}

### D1 - Alice is already BOOKED on 2026-11-05 (expected 409 Groomer is already booked on that date)
POST {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/save
Content-Type: application/json

{"sessionDate": "2026-11-05", "status": "BOOKED", "service": "Test", "petOwner": {"id": "652c2aa0-09fd-4016-8eff-3317e65a75f0"}, "groomer": {"id": "5c4e609d-f4d6-4ee8-ab45-3c71287204de"}}

### D1 - Eric only has a CANCELLED session on 2026-11-15, so it is allowed (expected 201)
POST {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/save
Content-Type: application/json

{"sessionDate": "2026-11-15", "status": "BOOKED", "service": "Test cancelled does not block", "petOwner": {"id": "652c2aa0-09fd-4016-8eff-3317e65a75f0"}, "groomer": {"id": "3b2f02fb-2135-4d82-b4c3-568837569199"}}

### D1 - same request again, now Eric is BOOKED that day (expected 409)
POST {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/save
Content-Type: application/json

{"sessionDate": "2026-11-15", "status": "BOOKED", "service": "Test cancelled does not block", "petOwner": {"id": "652c2aa0-09fd-4016-8eff-3317e65a75f0"}, "groomer": {"id": "3b2f02fb-2135-4d82-b4c3-568837569199"}}

### D1 - body says FINISHED but it must be saved as BOOKED (expected 201)
POST {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/save
Content-Type: application/json

{"sessionDate": "2026-12-01", "status": "FINISHED", "service": "Test status forced", "petOwner": {"id": "652c2aa0-09fd-4016-8eff-3317e65a75f0"}, "groomer": {"id": "aadd4397-a57b-4f64-89dd-2c5bc2b4374c"}}

### D1 - check: the session of 2026-12-01 must show BOOKED
GET {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/between?start=2026-12-01&end=2026-12-01



### D2 setup - create a temporary session (expected 201)
POST {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/save
Content-Type: application/json

{"sessionDate": "2027-01-10", "status": "BOOKED", "service": "Temp D2", "petOwner": {"id": "652c2aa0-09fd-4016-8eff-3317e65a75f0"}, "groomer": {"id": "aadd4397-a57b-4f64-89dd-2c5bc2b4374c"}}

### D2 setup - find its id
GET {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/between?start=2027-01-10&end=2027-01-10


@host = http://localhost:8081

### D2 1 - BOOKED to FINISHED is forbidden (expected 400 Cannot change status from BOOKED to FINISHED)
PATCH {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/99ff6ed3-8798-4983-8969-742025362e03/status?status=FINISHED

### D2 2 - BOOKED to IN_PROGRESS (expected 200 Grooming session status updated successfully)
PATCH {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/99ff6ed3-8798-4983-8969-742025362e03/status?status=IN_PROGRESS

### D2 3 - IN_PROGRESS to BOOKED is forbidden (expected 400 Cannot change status from IN_PROGRESS to BOOKED)
PATCH {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/99ff6ed3-8798-4983-8969-742025362e03/status?status=BOOKED

### D2 4 - IN_PROGRESS to FINISHED (expected 200 Grooming session status updated successfully)
PATCH {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/99ff6ed3-8798-4983-8969-742025362e03/status?status=FINISHED

### D2 5 - FINISHED is final (expected 400 Cannot change status from FINISHED to CANCELLED)
PATCH {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/99ff6ed3-8798-4983-8969-742025362e03/status?status=CANCELLED

### D2 6 - unknown id (expected 404 The grooming session with that id does not exist)
PATCH {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000/status?status=IN_PROGRESS

### D2 7 - invalid status value (expected 400)
PATCH {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/99ff6ed3-8798-4983-8969-742025362e03/status?status=XYZ

### D2 8 - PUT must NOT change the status: body says BOOKED but it stays FINISHED (expected 200 Grooming session updated successfully)
PUT {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/update/99ff6ed3-8798-4983-8969-742025362e03
Content-Type: application/json

{"sessionDate": "2027-01-10", "status": "BOOKED", "service": "Temp D2 edited", "petOwner": {"id": "652c2aa0-09fd-4016-8eff-3317e65a75f0"}, "groomer": {"id": "aadd4397-a57b-4f64-89dd-2c5bc2b4374c"}}

### D2 9 - check: service is "Temp D2 edited" and status is still FINISHED (expected 200)
GET {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/99ff6ed3-8798-4983-8969-742025362e03

### D2 10 - cleanup: delete the temporary session (expected 200 Grooming session deleted successfully)
DELETE {{host}}/api/grooming-sessions/delete/99ff6ed3-8798-4983-8969-742025362e03